Z||000000||sinoloa||03-17-2000||08:13 PM||||All of these conflicts are bringing me down. I hope things cool down and no one decides to leave since everyone contributes to the integrity of this place. I first came to this forum when my Fiero broke down just a few weeks after I bought it. The members' names (dogtired, disillusioned) reflected exactly how I felt. I thought I had made a mistake by buying it. The humor of the wonderful members here brightened my mood and in turn I am a Fiero - person for life. You people have great spirits, enthusiasm and humor. When I need a laugh, I come here. TOM: my daddy (who also posts under Sinoloa) is a die hard Mustang man and I have yet to find a Mustang Forum as entertaining as this Fiero Forum. I see no reason that anyone has to leave. Crap happens, but there's room enough for all of us. I'm only 21 and even I know that.<p>[This message has been edited by sinoloa (edited 03-17-2000).]||||reg||11
